{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749260/extras/NannyWaytingBus.jpg?t=1761554922\" /></span><br><br>&quot;Nanny's Journey&quot; is not for the <strong>faint of heart</strong>: this platform game, where every <strong>jump</strong> and every <strong>move</strong> counts, will challenge you like never before. <br>Use the Devil's Tail to climb back up through the level, designed to test your <strong>dexterity</strong>, <strong>patience</strong> and <strong>resilience</strong>. <br>Collecting the <strong>ghost bonuses</strong> will give you a considerable advantage in completing your journey!<br><br>The difficulty will make each success a real victory or not!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749260/extras/773ec2cffb4693efbb400eaa7d40b502.poster.avif?t=1761554922\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749260/extras/773ec2cffb4693efbb400eaa7d40b502.webm?t=1761554922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749260/extras/773ec2cffb4693efbb400eaa7d40b502.mp4?t=1761554922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Our heroine isn't just any old lady. With her $*&amp;% character, she seizes diabolical power. Her new trump card? An <strong>infernal grappling hook</strong> to navigate through <strong>flames</strong> and the <strong>abyss</strong>! <br>Join <strong>Nanny</strong> on her frantic journey and prove that age is just a number. <br><br>Download &quot;Nanny's Journey&quot; and plunge into the wildest adventure of your life. <br>The Devil better watch out, because Nanny's coming, and she's not messing around!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s